ttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117942.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds comprehensive unit tests for the `DisjointSet` class (`core/math/disjoint_set.h`), which currently has no test coverage.\r\n\r\n## Tests cover\r\n  - **Insert & representatives** — single element, multiple elements, duplicate idempotency  \r\n  - **Union & find** — two elements, transitivity, redundant union, multiple disjoint sets, merging two groups                                                                         \r\n  - **get_members** — single-element set, after union, multiple disjoint sets, non-representative element (error guard), non-existent element (error guard)               \r\n  - **Union by rank** — chain of unions (3 pairs merged incrementally) verifying correctness \r\n\r\nContributes to #43440.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117942/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117942/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}